    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:1em; border:1px solid #999; font-size:90%; text-align:center; background:#363636\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i>This article details the Chain <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Simple_Weapon_(Melee)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Simple Weapon (Melee)\">Simple Weapon (Melee)</a> created by <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a>. You may be looking for the Core Rulebook <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival_Gear\" title=\"Survival Gear\">Survival Gear</a> of the same name, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Chain\" title=\"Chain\">Chain</a>.</i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#6c3636;\"> \n <tbody>\n  <tr> \n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has not been reviewed in a meaningful manner. If you wish to review this content yourself, then see <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> for more details.</b></i> </td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Homebrew Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Clone_Wars_Saga_Edition_Fan_Sourcebook\" title=\"Clone Wars Saga Edition Fan Sourcebook\">Clone Wars Saga Edition Fan Sourcebook</a>&nbsp;- Grand Army of the Republic (Part 2)</i> </p><p>A heavy length of chain, it can be used as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Garrote\" title=\"Garrote\">Garrote</a> (requiring the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_Proficiency_(Garrote)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Garrote)\">Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Garrote)</a> feat) or as a bludgeoning weapon. Sometimes chains have several links filed down to razor sharpness, changing its damage and type. </p>",
